@IssuePortal.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5126

### Create a new issue
POST http://localhost:5126/api/issues
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Login fungerar inte",
  "description": "Användaren kan inte logga in.",
  "projectId": 1
}


### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5126/api/users


### Create a new user
POST http://localhost:5126/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jonos",
  "email": "jonos@example.com"
}


### Get user by ID
GET http://localhost:5126/api/users/1

### Update user
PUT http://localhost:5126/api/users/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jonos Mirzazada",
  "email": "jonos.mirzazada@example.com"
}



### Delete user
DELETE http://localhost:5126/api/users/1